<title>MEXICO: Grupo Azucarero Mexico places shares for $40 mln.</title>
<headline>Grupo Azucarero Mexico places shares for $40 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican sugar mill owners Grupo Azucarero Mexico SA said Tuesday it completed a private placement of common shares for a total of $40 million.</p>
<p>In a statement published in national newspapers, the company said the placement had been made with a group of investors lead by a subsidiary of  Equity Group Investment Inc.</p>
<p>Mexican brokerage Invermexico and  Blackstone Group acted as financial assessors, the statement said.</p>
<p>--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530</p>
